From c348651d3916a1d20ea015719c81beaf09621493 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@st.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Jan 2023 16:06:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 266/954] feat(st-ddr): stm32mp2: implement software
 self-refresh sequences

Implement software self-refresh sequences in the STOP context.
Create new internal services to disable DFI low power interface and loop
on PHY LP3 state. Add LPDDR4 specific treatment in sr_loop() to poll on
software SRPD (self-refresh power down) state in DDRCTRL_STAT register.

ssr_entry() is added to prepare standby entry function, coming in the
next commits.

Add all the relative definitions (DDRCTRL and DDRPHY register fields).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 9a5b73ded4a56a5acd0d83534282eaed5f2dff32 feat(st-ddr): stm32mp2: implement software self-refresh sequences]
Signed-off-by: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@st.com>
